@121844=~Baldemar Thurlow~
@121845=~Arden Thurlow~
@121846=~Louvado seja Auril!~
@121847=~Arden Thurlow~
@121848=~Thom Farold~
@121849=~Jovem Ned~
@121850=~Digby~
